<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT WEST INDIES BY EIGHT WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT WEST INDIES BY EIGHT WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat the West Indies by</p>
<p>eight wickets in their limited overs World Series match at the</p>
<p>Sydney Cricket Ground on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 181 in 47.3 overs ; Pakistan 183 for</p>
<p>two in 39.2 overs.</p>
</text>
